@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Tasco Insurance (Cong ty TNHH Bao hiem Tasco), combined motor vehicle insurance rules,
-- issued with Decision No. 53/2024/QD-BH Tasco of 22 May 2024.
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/tasco-combined-motor-2024.txt, the OCR text (tesseract 5, `vie`,
-- 200 dpi, --psm 4) of the 25-page image scan whose sha256 is 413cb02f...e09be92.
-- A `src:N` comment quotes line N of that text, generated by tools/vnsrc.py and never typed.
-- Where the OCR misreads the page, the page's own words follow on a `[page-read p.N]` line.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. Rates are percent literals.
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact,
-- or the certificate, a police record or an assessment report records it. Whether the fact
-- makes Tasco liable is a rule, and belongs in the chapter module that says so.
-- The last section declares the shapes of the answers; those are not facts, and say so.

§ `Nouns for the combined motor vehicle insurance rules`

§§ `Parties and their acts`

-- The parties the rules name. Definitions 1-5 of Phan I (see tasco-p0-definitions.l4).
DECLARE `A party` IS ONE OF
    `Tasco`                                   -- definition 1
    `the buyer`                               -- definition 2, the policyholder
    `the owner`                               -- definition 5, "Chủ xe"
    `the person driving`
    `the competent authority`                 -- police, local government, inspection bodies

-- The acts the rules oblige, permit or forbid (Điều 3-6 and 13). Each is named for what is done.
DECLARE `An act under the rules` IS ONE OF
    `refund the overpaid premium or demand the premium due`          -- Điều 3.1
    `refund the premium for the remaining period`                    -- Điều 3.2
    `give written notice of termination`                             -- Điều 3.2
    `suspend performance of the contract`                            -- Điều 4.1.7, 5.1.4
    `explain the terms and conditions`                               -- Điều 4.2.1
    `issue the certificate or the contract`                          -- Điều 4.2.2
    `pay the compensation`                                           -- Điều 4.2.3
    `verify the claim file itself`                                   -- Điều 4.2.3, second paragraph
    `explain the refusal in writing`                                 -- Điều 4.2.4
    `advance part of the necessary costs`                            -- Điều 4.2.5
    `guide the claimant in assembling the claim file`                -- Điều 4.2.6
    `re-assess the risk and the premium`                             -- Điều 4.2.7
    `answer the request to reduce the premium in writing`            -- Điều 5.1.4
    `notify Tasco of the change`                                     -- Điều 5.2.4
    `notify Tasco of the loss immediately`                           -- Điều 5.2.6.1
    `notify the nearest police or local authority`                   -- Điều 5.2.6.1
    `move, dismantle or repair the damaged property`                 -- Điều 5.2.6.2
    `notify Tasco of the loss in writing`                            -- Điều 5.2.6.3
    `hand the replaced parts over to Tasco`                          -- Điều 5.2.9
    `notify the police and Tasco of the theft`                       -- Điều 5.2.10
    `notify Tasco of the transfer of ownership`                      -- Điều 6
    `gather and supply the details, documents and photographs of the loss` -- Điều 7.4
    `give an opinion on dismantling the vehicle`                     -- Điều 13.1.2(a)

-- A person's relation to the vehicle, for definition 5 ("Chủ xe", src:67-69).
DECLARE `A relation to the vehicle` IS ONE OF
    `owns it`
    `lawfully possesses and uses it, entrusted by the owner`
    `actually owns it under a contract of sale, not yet registered`
    `none of these`

§§ `Time`

-- A month of the calendar, for "Thời gian sử dụng xe" (definition 7), which counts months.
DECLARE `A calendar month` HAS
    `year`  IS A NUMBER
    `month` IS A NUMBER

§§ `The vehicle`

-- The rules apply to "xe ô tô, bao gồm: Xe ô tô; máy kéo; Xe Rơ moóc hoặc sơ mi rơ moóc"
-- drawn by a car or tractor (src:47-48). The fourth member makes a vehicle outside that list
-- representable rather than silently assumed away.
DECLARE `A kind of vehicle` IS ONE OF
    `a car`
    `a tractor`
    `a trailer or semi-trailer drawn by a car or a tractor`
    `a vehicle of another kind`

-- Definitions 13 and 14 (src:102-120) name two kinds of drive; the first member is neither.
DECLARE `A means of propulsion` IS ONE OF
    `an internal combustion engine only`
    `electric motors only, powered solely by the traction battery`          -- definition 13
    `an internal combustion engine together with an electric motor`         -- definition 14

-- What the overload tests of Điều 11.10, 13.1.4 and 15.7 measure the load against.
DECLARE `What the vehicle carries` IS ONE OF
    `goods only`
    `people only`
    `both goods and people`

-- `used for business`: the depreciation table of Điều 18 heads its two column groups for
-- vehicles not used and used for business:
-- "Xe không kinh doanh" / "Xe kinh doanh" [page-read p.15]
-- and Điều 35 heads its own "Không KDVT" and "KDVT". The rules define neither, and this
-- encoding reads both as the one fact (NOTES.md, fork F14).
-- `month of first registration in Vietnam`, `imported having been used abroad` and
-- `year of manufacture` are the facts definition 7 counts the vehicle's period of use from.
DECLARE `A vehicle` HAS
    `kind of vehicle`                         IS A `A kind of vehicle`
    `propulsion`                              IS A `A means of propulsion`
    `what it carries`                         IS A `What the vehicle carries`
    `used for business`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `number of seats`                         IS A NUMBER
    `month of first registration in Vietnam`  IS A `A calendar month`
    `imported having been used abroad`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `year of manufacture`                     IS A NUMBER

§§ `The contract and the certificate`

-- The additional clauses of Chương VI, by their codes BS01-BS15 (src:1173-1410).
DECLARE `An additional clause` IS ONE OF
    `BS01 new for old`
    `BS02 choice of repairer`
    `BS03 engine damage in flood water`
    `BS04 theft of parts`
    `BS05 outside Vietnam`
    `BS06 duty-free or temporarily imported vehicle`
    `BS07 hire car during repair`
    `BS08 temporary circulation`
    `BS09 operation within a private site`
    `BS10 driving-school vehicle`
    `BS11 additional equipment`
    `BS12 vandalism and riot`
    `BS13 special equipment`
    `BS14 goods of the vehicle owner`
    `BS15 electric vehicle battery`

-- The contract's own terms, as the certificate or contract records them. Điều 2 leaves the
-- period to the certificate; the premium and how and when it is paid to the parties.
-- `agreed date for paying the premium`: NOTHING where there is no written agreement on the
-- time for payment (Điều 2, third paragraph, contemplates that absence).
-- `date the premium was paid in full`: NOTHING where it has not been paid in full.
-- `a written agreement lets the buyer owe the premium`: the agreement Điều 3.1 names.
DECLARE `The contract` HAS
    `date the contract was concluded`                     IS A DATE
    `start of the insurance period`                       IS A DATE
    `end of the insurance period`                         IS A DATE
    `premium`                                             IS A NUMBER
    `agreed date for paying the premium`                  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the premium was paid in full`                   IS A MAYBE DATE
    `a written agreement lets the buyer owe the premium`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `vehicle`                                             IS A `A vehicle`

-- Chương II, physical damage: the figures the certificate states.
-- `sum insured`: Điều 16.1. `market value when the contract was concluded`: Điều 16.3, as Tasco
-- determined it. `deductible stated on the certificate`: Điều 19.3 and Điều 35; NOTHING where
-- the certificate states none. `insurance period in months`: as the certificate states it, for
-- the BS04 count limit.
DECLARE `The physical damage cover` HAS
    `sum insured`                                  IS A NUMBER
    `market value when the contract was concluded` IS A NUMBER
    `deductible stated on the certificate`         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `additional clauses held`                      IS A LIST OF `An additional clause`
    `insurance period in months`                   IS A NUMBER

-- Chương III: Điều 22 leaves the sum insured to the certificate; Điều 24.4 compares the number
-- of persons the certificate insures with the number on board.
DECLARE `The accident cover` HAS
    `sum insured per person`         IS A NUMBER
    `number of persons insured`      IS A NUMBER

-- Chương IV: the limit of liability on the certificate ("mức trách nhiệm", src:1033), which
-- Điều 29 calls the total limit the owner took ("tổng mức trách nhiệm bảo hiểm", src:1071).
DECLARE `The goods liability cover` HAS
    `limit of liability`             IS A NUMBER

-- Chương V: the voluntary limits the owner chose ("MTN tự nguyện", src:1133; "mức trách nhiệm
-- tài sản lựa chọn tham gia", src:1142-1143).
DECLARE `The voluntary liability cover` HAS
    `limit for bodily injury per person`   IS A NUMBER
    `limit for property per accident`      IS A NUMBER

§§ `The circumstances of a loss (Điều 11, the general exclusions)`

-- The inspection certificate ("Giấy chứng nhận kiểm định an toàn kỹ thuật và bảo vệ môi
-- trường", src:616-617) at the time of the loss, with the three causes of lapse Điều 11.1 spares.
DECLARE `The inspection certificate at the time of the loss` IS ONE OF
    `valid and in force`
    `lapsed only through a change of tyre or rim size`
        HAS `the new sizes conform to the manufacturer's recommendation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `lapsed only through fitting bumper guards, a roof rack, a winch or a tow hook`
    `lapsed only through fitting extra seats`
    `not valid or not in force for another reason`

-- The driving licence ("Giấy phép lái xe", GPLX), in each of the states Điều 11.2 names.
DECLARE `The driving licence at the time of the loss` IS ONE OF
    `a valid licence in force, appropriate to the vehicle`
    `no licence`
    `a licence whose blank number or dates do not match the licence register`
    `a licence not issued by a competent authority`
    `an altered licence`
    `a licence expired at the time of the accident`
    `a licence not appropriate to the vehicle`
    `a licence suspended for a period or withdrawn`
    `a licence lost in this same accident, confirmed by the competent authority`
    `a licence lost before the accident, reported, awaiting reissue, with its original records`

-- `of an age the road traffic law permits`: Điều 11.2 excludes a driver under or over the age
-- the road traffic law sets. The law is outside these rules, so the answer is a fact.
-- `alcohol above the Ministry of Health's normal level`: Điều 11.4 measures against the
-- Ministry of Health's guidance in force; the reading is a fact.
DECLARE `The driver at the time of the loss` HAS
    `of an age the road traffic law permits`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `driving licence`                                       IS A `The driving licence at the time of the loss`
    `alcohol above the Ministry of Health's normal level`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `using prohibited drugs or stimulants`                  IS A BOOLEAN

-- Điều 11.5, and the further prohibited-road case of Điều 13.1.1(c).
DECLARE `The way the vehicle was driven` HAS
    `entered a prohibited road or area`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `drove against the direction of traffic`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `reversed on an expressway`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `turned or made a U-turn where prohibited`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `stopped or parked where a sign prohibits it`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `ran a red light or disobeyed a traffic controller`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `drove at night without the required lights`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `entered a bus or tram lane, or a road barred to its class by a sign` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The overload tests (Điều 11.10, 13.1.4, 15.7) compare what was carried, towed or lifted with
-- the figures on the inspection certificate. Children under 7 are not counted (src:660-661).
DECLARE `The load at the time of the loss` HAS
    `permitted load`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `load carried, towed or lifted`                         IS A NUMBER
    `permitted number of people`                            IS A NUMBER
    `number of people carried, not counting children under 7` IS A NUMBER

-- Điều 11.11 takes the speed "theo kết quả xác định từ cơ quan chức năng" (src:665-666);
-- Điều 13.1.2(b) needs that finding in writing. NOTHING where the authority found no speed.
DECLARE `The speed at the time of the loss` HAS
    `speed limit`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `speed found by the competent authority`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the finding is in writing`                             IS A BOOLEAN

-- The facts every general exclusion reads, gathered for one loss.
-- `intentional damage by an excluded person`: an intentional act by the buyer, the insured,
-- the owner, the driver, the injured person or a person with an interest in owning or using the
-- vehicle (Điều 11.1).
-- `in road traffic`: definition 16; Điều 11.1 tests the inspection certificate "Tại thời điểm xe
-- tham gia giao thông xảy ra tổn thất".
DECLARE `The circumstances of the loss` HAS
    `intentional damage by an excluded person`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `in road traffic`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `inspection certificate`                                IS A `The inspection certificate at the time of the loss`
    `driver`                                                IS A `The driver at the time of the loss`
    `special equipment operated without the required permit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `way the vehicle was driven`                            IS A `The way the vehicle was driven`
    `racing, lawful or not`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `towing another vehicle unlawfully`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `carrying goods unlawfully`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `carrying explosives or flammable substances`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `outside Vietnam`                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `war or terrorism`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `vandalism in a protest, riot or public disorder`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `bombs, mines or explosive devices`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `load`                                                  IS A `The load at the time of the loss`
    `speed`                                                 IS A `The speed at the time of the loss`

§§ `Conduct after the loss (Điều 5.2.6-5.2.8 and Điều 13)`

-- `Tasco notified immediately`, `police or local authority notified immediately`: "ngay"; the
-- rules give no number of hours, so whether notice was immediate is a fact (fork F9).
-- `day written notice was sent, counted from the day of the loss`: day 0 is the day of the loss;
-- NOTHING where no written notice (or electronic declaration) was sent.
-- `prevented by force majeure`: "bất khả kháng", which Điều 5.2.6.1, 5.2.6.3 and 13.1.1(a) except.
-- `Tasco assessed the damage within that period`: the second exception of Điều 13.1.1(a).
-- `the rate Tasco chose under 13.1.2` and `... 13.1.3`: Tasco's choice within the ranges those
-- points give "tùy theo mức độ lỗi"; NOTHING where Tasco has not chosen.
DECLARE `The conduct after the loss` HAS
    `Tasco notified immediately`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `day written notice was sent, counted from the day of the loss` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `police or local authority notified immediately`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `prevented by force majeure`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `Tasco assessed the damage within that period`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `full rescue, mitigation and scene-preservation measures taken` IS A BOOLEAN
    `moved only for safety or on an authority's order`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `moved, dismantled or repaired without Tasco's consent`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `that was necessary for safety or ordered by an authority`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `Tasco's opinion on dismantling was overdue`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `a third party is liable for the loss`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `right of claim preserved and transferred to Tasco with the file` IS A BOOLEAN
    `cooperated with Tasco in recovering from the third party`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `settled with the third party without Tasco's consent`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `claim documents truthful`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `cooperated in verifying the claim documents`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `proposal misstated the use of the vehicle, so too little premium was collected` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an increase in risk was not notified, so too little premium was collected`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium actually paid`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `premium that should have been paid`                           IS A NUMBER
    `the rate Tasco chose under 13.1.2`                            IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the rate Tasco chose under 13.1.3`                            IS A MAYBE NUMBER

§§ `A loss to the vehicle (Chương II)`

-- The five cases of Điều 14.1, and a sixth for a cause the list does not name.
DECLARE `A cause of physical damage` IS ONE OF
    `collision, overturning, sinking, falling, or impact by an external object`   -- 14.1.1
    `fire or explosion`                                                           -- 14.1.2
    `a natural catastrophe`                                                       -- 14.1.3
    `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`                                       -- 14.1.4
    `malicious damage by a third party`                                           -- 14.1.5
    `theft or robbery of parts of the vehicle`                                    -- not in 14.1; 15.4, BS04
    `a cause not listed in art 14.1`

-- The facts the specific exclusions of Điều 15 read, one per point (15.7 reads the load above).
DECLARE `The facts for the physical damage exclusions` HAS
    `wear and tear, inherent vice, loss of commercial value, defect, or damage from repair`  IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.1
    `water hammer in the combustion engine from operating in flood water`                   IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.2, first limb
    `electric motor of an electric car damaged by operating in flood water`                 IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.2, second limb
    `only tyres, tarpaulins or badges damaged, nothing else by the same cause in the accident` IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.3
    `whole vehicle lost by fraud or abuse of trust`                                         IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.5
    `electrical damage by overload, overpressure, short circuit, self-heating, arcing or leakage` IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.6
    `loss of equipment fitted beyond the manufacturer's, not protective and not permitted`   IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.8, first limb
    `loss caused by such added equipment`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.8, second limb
    `loss caused by the operation of the vehicle's own special equipment`                   IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.9
    `damage by the goods carried, not from a collision or overturning`                      IS A BOOLEAN  -- 15.10

-- The kinds of part the depreciation rules of Điều 18.1.2 tell apart.
-- `a material or spare part`: the table's first column of rates in each group,
-- "Vật tư, phụ tùng" [page-read p.15]
-- `the traction battery`: its second, "Bộ pin điện động cơ" (definition 13). `a part listed in art 18.1.2(c)`: air-conditioning gas, tyres and
-- tubes, batteries, tarpaulins, air, oil and fuel filters, lubricating oil (src:915-916).
DECLARE `A kind of part` IS ONE OF
    `a material or spare part`
    `the traction battery`
    `a part listed in art 18.1.2(c)`

-- One damaged part. `replaced with a new part`: TRUE where it could not be repaired to the
-- manufacturer's safety standard and was replaced (Điều 18.1.1). `cost`: the actual reasonable
-- cost of the repair or of the new part. `months since last replaced new, with documents`: the
-- case of Điều 18.1.2(c), second bullet; NOTHING where the part was never replaced new or the
-- replacement is not documented.
DECLARE `A damaged part` HAS
    `kind of part`                                 IS A `A kind of part`
    `replaced with a new part`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `cost`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `months since last replaced new, with documents` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- The damage, as the assessment records it.
-- `share of the painted surface damaged`: a fraction (Điều 18.1.3).
-- `market value at the time and place of the loss`: of a vehicle of the same type and
-- specification (Điều 18.2.1, 18.2.3).
-- `police concluded by suspending the investigation or prosecution`: Điều 18.2.2.
DECLARE `The damage to the vehicle` HAS
    `damaged parts`                                        IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
    `share of the painted surface damaged`                 IS A NUMBER
    `cost of repainting the whole vehicle`                 IS A NUMBER
    `market value at the time and place of the loss`       IS A NUMBER
    `costs of preventing further loss`                     IS A NUMBER
    `costs of rescue and transport to the nearest repairer` IS A NUMBER
    `owner asks to keep the wrecked vehicle`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `Tasco's valuation of the wreck`                       IS A NUMBER
    `police concluded by suspending the investigation or prosecution` IS A BOOLEAN

-- One loss to the insured vehicle.
-- `sudden and unforeseen`: the chapeau of Điều 14.1, "thiên tai, tai nạn bất ngờ, không lường
-- trước được". `done by a person on the vehicle`: the exception inside Điều 14.1.5.
DECLARE `A loss to the vehicle` HAS
    `date of the loss`                                     IS A DATE
    `cause of the damage`                                  IS A `A cause of physical damage`
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `done by the owner, the driver, the assistant or a person on the vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN
    `circumstances`                                        IS A `The circumstances of the loss`
    `exclusion facts`                                      IS A `The facts for the physical damage exclusions`
    `damage`                                               IS A `The damage to the vehicle`
    `conduct after the loss`                               IS A `The conduct after the loss`

§§ `An accident to a person on the vehicle (Chương III)`

DECLARE `A role on the vehicle` IS ONE OF
    `driving`
    `assisting the driver`             -- "phụ xe"
    `riding as a passenger`

DECLARE `An outcome for the person` IS ONE OF
    `death`
    `permanent total disability`
    `temporary injury`
    `permanent partial disability`

-- `percentage in the Decree's table`: Điều 24.2 pays by the table of compensation for injury
-- annexed to the Government decree on compulsory motor liability insurance in force when the
-- policy was issued. The table is not in these rules; NOTHING where nobody has read it off.
DECLARE `An accident to a person` HAS
    `role`                                                IS A `A role on the vehicle`
    `under 7 years of age`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `outcome`                                             IS A `An outcome for the person`
    `accident directly connected with the use of the vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the vehicle, or getting on or off it, in road traffic` IS A BOOLEAN
    `person intentionally caused the accident`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `percentage in the Decree's table`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `number of people on board, not counting children under 7` IS A NUMBER
    `circumstances`                                       IS A `The circumstances of the loss`

§§ `A loss to goods carried (Chương IV)`

-- The perils of Điều 26 (src:1022-1024), and a last member for any other cause.
DECLARE `A cause of loss to goods` IS ONE OF
    `the vehicle hit, struck, overturned, fell over, fell or sank`
    `fire or explosion on the vehicle`
    `other objects fell on or struck the vehicle`
    `storm, flood, landslide, lightning, earthquake, hail or tsunami`
    `theft or robbery`
    `another cause`

-- The special goods of Điều 28, and ordinary goods.
DECLARE `A kind of goods` IS ONE OF
    `ordinary goods`
    `gold, silver or precious stones`
    `antiques, rare art, ornamental plants or rocks`
    `money, or stamps and documents of money value`
    `corpses or remains`
    `ornamental living creatures`
    `radioactive material`

-- `liability to the cargo owner under the Civil Code`: what the owner must pay the cargo owner,
-- which Điều 26 measures "theo Bộ Luật dân sự"; that law is outside these rules, so it is an input.
DECLARE `A loss to goods carried` HAS
    `cause of the loss to the goods`                      IS A `A cause of loss to goods`
    `kind of goods`                                       IS A `A kind of goods`
    `liability to the cargo owner under the Civil Code`   IS A NUMBER
    `costs of preventing or reducing the loss`            IS A NUMBER
    `costs of preserving, handling and storing the goods after the accident` IS A NUMBER
    `owner or driver failed to guard and preserve the goods` IS A BOOLEAN   -- 27.1
    `the whole vehicle was stolen with the goods`         IS A BOOLEAN       -- 27.2, exception
    `wrong kind, specification or marking`                IS A BOOLEAN       -- 27.2
    `unlawful circulation or seizure by the authorities`  IS A BOOLEAN       -- 27.3
    `vehicle unsuitable for the goods`                    IS A BOOLEAN       -- 27.4
    `natural deterioration, poor quality, packing, stowage or shifting not from a collision` IS A BOOLEAN  -- 27.5
    `late delivery, wrong recipient, short or wrong delivery` IS A BOOLEAN   -- 27.6
    `circumstances`                                       IS A `The circumstances of the loss`
    `conduct after the loss`                              IS A `The conduct after the loss`

§§ `A third-party claim (Chương V)`

-- `holds compulsory liability insurance with Tasco in force`: Điều 30.
-- `excluded under the compulsory insurance decree`: Điều 33.2 adopts the exclusions of the
-- decree in force when the certificate was issued; the decree is outside these rules.
-- `compulsory limit`: the limit of the compulsory insurance for this head, set by the
-- Government (Điều 32, 34.2); outside these rules, so an input.
-- `payment percentage in the Decree's table`: Điều 34.1 "Tỉ lệ trả tiền"; an input.
-- `share of fault`: Điều 34, "Mức độ lỗi (*)", as the authorities' file or Tasco's agreed
-- finding fixes it; a fraction.
DECLARE `A head of third-party loss` IS ONE OF
    `bodily injury or death`
    `damage to property`

DECLARE `A third-party claim` HAS
    `head`                                                IS A `A head of third-party loss`
    `holds compulsory liability insurance with Tasco in force` IS A BOOLEAN
    `excluded under the compulsory insurance decree`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `compulsory limit`                                    IS A NUMBER
    `payment percentage in the Decree's table`            IS A NUMBER
    `actual damage`                                       IS A NUMBER
    `share of fault`                                      IS A NUMBER
    `amount the owner actually paid the third party`      IS A NUMBER
    `circumstances`                                       IS A `The circumstances of the loss`
    `conduct after the loss`                              IS A `The conduct after the loss`

§§ `The shapes of the answers (not facts)`

-- What a claim comes to. Three outcomes the rules name, each with what it carries: outside the
-- cover (Điều 4.1.3 "không thuộc phạm vi"), excluded (the exclusion points that fire), payable.
DECLARE `An exclusion point` IS ONE OF
    `art 11.1 intentional damage`
    `art 11.1 no valid inspection certificate`
    `art 11.2 driver's age or licence`
    `art 11.3 special equipment operated without a permit`
    `art 11.4 alcohol or drugs`
    `art 11.5 prohibited road or manoeuvre`
    `art 11.6 racing, unlawful towing or goods`
    `art 11.7 explosives or unlawful goods`
    `art 11.8 outside Vietnam`
    `art 11.9 war, terrorism, riot or explosives`
    `art 11.10 overload of 50% or more`
    `art 11.11 speed 50% or more over the limit`
    `art 15.1 wear, defect or repair`
    `art 15.2 engine damage in flood water`
    `art 15.3 tyres, tarpaulins or badges alone`
    `art 15.4 theft of parts`
    `art 15.5 fraud or abuse of trust`
    `art 15.6 electrical damage`
    `art 15.7 overload of 50% or more`
    `art 15.8 added equipment`
    `art 15.9 own special equipment`
    `art 15.10 damage by the goods carried`
    `art 23 self-inflicted accident`
    `art 27.1 goods left unguarded`
    `art 27.2 theft or wrong goods`
    `art 27.3 unlawful circulation or seizure`
    `art 27.4 unsuitable vehicle`
    `art 27.5 nature, packing or stowage of goods`
    `art 27.6 late or wrong delivery`
    `art 28 special goods`
    `art 33.1 outside Vietnam`
    `art 33.2 excluded by the compulsory insurance decree`
    `art 33.3 no valid inspection certificate`
    `art 33.4 prohibited road or manoeuvre`
    `art 33.5 racing, unlawful towing or goods`
    `art 33.6 war, terrorism or riot`
    `BS05 theft in a country named on the certificate`
    `BS08 the maker's or assembler's technical fault`
    `BS10 no instructor present, or no auxiliary brake`
    `BS12 bombs or explosive devices`
    `BS13 unsafe vehicle, unlicensed operator, or rules broken`
    `BS15 battery not genuine`
    `BS15 battery damaged alone`
    `BS15 technical fault, wear or charging capacity`

-- `not yet payable`: the rules name a condition still to come, as Điều 18.2.2 does for a
-- stolen vehicle until the police conclude.
DECLARE `The answer on a claim` IS ONE OF
    `outside the cover`  HAS `the reason`         IS A STRING
    `excluded`           HAS `the points`         IS A LIST OF `An exclusion point`
    `not yet payable`    HAS `what is awaited`    IS A STRING
    `payable`            HAS `the amount`         IS A NUMBER

-- What a transfer of ownership does to the contract (Điều 6.1, 6.2).
DECLARE `What a transfer does to the contract` IS ONE OF
    `it continues for the new owner from the transfer to the end of the period`
    `it ends at the moment of the transfer`

-- Who bears the cost of an independent assessment (Điều 7.3).
DECLARE `Who pays for the independent assessment` IS ONE OF
    `Tasco pays`
    `the insured, the owner or the driver pays`

-- The kinds of claim the claim file of Điều 8 tells apart (8.1.3(a)-(c)).
DECLARE `A kind of claim` IS ONE OF
    `physical damage to the vehicle`
    `theft or robbery of the whole vehicle`
    `theft or robbery of parts of the vehicle`
    `injury to a person on the vehicle`
    `death of a person on the vehicle`
    `liability for goods carried`

-- The documents Điều 8 lists, in its order. "(nếu có)" is carried as "if any".
DECLARE `A claim document` IS ONE OF
    `the notice of loss and claim, on Tasco's form`                                   -- 1.1
    `the certificate or contract, and other written agreements, if any`                -- 1.2(a)
    `the vehicle registration, and the driver's valid licence`                         -- 1.2(b)
    `papers on a sale, transfer, gift or authority to use the vehicle, if any`         -- 1.2(c)
    `the valid inspection certificate, save for temporary or first circulation`        -- 1.2(d)
    `quotations and invoices for the repair or replacement`                            -- 1.3(a)
    `proof of necessary and reasonable costs spent to limit the loss`                  -- 1.3(a)
    `the police-certified report of the theft of the vehicle`                          -- 1.3(a)
    `the decision to prosecute, if any`                                                -- 1.3(a)
    `the decision suspending the investigation or prosecution, if any`                 -- 1.3(a)
    `the police-certified report of documents lost with the vehicle, if any`           -- 1.3(a)
    `the police-certified report of the theft of parts, stating any documents lost`    -- 1.3(a)
    `medical records of the injury`                                                    -- 1.3(b)
    `the death certificate, and proof of lawful inheritance`                           -- 1.3(b)
    `documents of the origin and value of the goods`                                   -- 1.3(c)
    `the record of the loss`                                                           -- 1.3(c)
    `proof of the owner's compensation to the cargo owner`                             -- 1.3(c)
    `the record of settlement or conciliation, if settled`                             -- 1.4
    `a court judgment or decision in force, if any`                                    -- 1.5
    `the papers passing the right of recovery to Tasco`                                -- 1.6
    `the scene inspection record, if any`                                              -- 2.1(a)
    `the scene diagram and photographs, if any`                                        -- 2.1(b)
    `the vehicle inspection record, if any`                                            -- 2.1(c)
    `the preliminary investigation notice, if any`                                     -- 2.1(d)
    `the accident settlement record or investigation conclusion, if any`               -- 2.1(e)
    `papers on the third party's liability, if any`                                    -- 2.2
    `the damage assessment agreed by the parties`                                      -- 2.3
    `other relevant documents, if any`                                                 -- 3

-- An exclusion point, with whether it fires on the facts: the rows each chapter checks.
DECLARE `A candidate exclusion` HAS
    `point`    IS A `An exclusion point`
    `fires`    IS A BOOLEAN

-- The reductions of Điều 13.1, by point.
DECLARE `A reduction point` IS ONE OF
    `art 13.1.1(a) late notice`
    `art 13.1.1(b) rescue and scene not secured`
    `art 13.1.1(c) bus lane or barred road`
    `art 13.1.2(a) moved or repaired without consent`
    `art 13.1.2(b) speed 20% to under 50% over`
    `art 13.1.3(a) right against third party lost`
    `art 13.1.3(b) untruthful or uncooperative`
    `art 13.1.4 overload over 20% and under 50%`
    `art 13.1.5 premium underpaid`

-- A reduction point, whether it applies, and its rate.
DECLARE `A reduction` HAS
    `point`    IS A `A reduction point`
    `applies`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `rate`     IS A NUMBER

-- One row of the depreciation table of Điều 18.1.2(b): the four rates, in the table's column
-- order. Built positionally (OF) under a ruler that names the columns.
DECLARE `A row of the depreciation table` HAS
    `not for business, materials and spare parts`  IS A NUMBER
    `not for business, traction battery`           IS A NUMBER
    `for business, materials and spare parts`      IS A NUMBER
    `for business, traction battery`               IS A NUMBER

§§ `The facts the additional clauses of Chương VI read`

-- The kinds of place BS09 names: its condition lists eight (src:1301-1302), its benefit five
-- (src:1306-1307); `a public road` is none of them.
DECLARE `A kind of site` IS ONE OF
    `a construction site`
    `a farm`
    `a factory`
    `an industrial zone`
    `an airport`
    `a port`
    `a warehouse`
    `a mining area`
    `a public road`

-- One day of a hire car under BS07. `day, counting the day of the loss as day 1`: fork F34.
DECLARE `A day of hire` HAS
    `day, counting the day of the loss as day 1`        IS A NUMBER
    `the insured vehicle was under repair`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insured vehicle was held by the authorities`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the hire cost that day`                            IS A NUMBER

-- The facts the BS clauses read, gathered for one loss to the vehicle. A clause not held never
-- reads its facts, so a caller may answer them as they please for a clause not held.
DECLARE `The facts for the additional clauses` HAS
    `the vehicle was in operation in the flood water`                         IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS03, definition 15
    `the stolen parts are keys or a remote control`                           IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS04
    `parts thefts already paid under this contract`                           IS A NUMBER   -- BS04
    `the loss occurred in a country named on the certificate`                 IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS05
    `the vehicle holds a valid circulation permit in that country`            IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS05
    `temporarily imported for re-export, duty-free, or of a foreign mission`  IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS06
    `insured value before taxes`                                              IS A NUMBER   -- BS06
    `the vehicle is repaired in Vietnam`                                      IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS06
    `in transit from factory or customs to delivery, or awaiting registration` IS A BOOLEAN -- BS08
    `holds the factory quality slip, or the import quality certificate and customs clearance` IS A BOOLEAN -- BS08
    `days of temporary cover`                                                 IS A NUMBER   -- BS08
    `a longer temporary cover agreed in writing`                              IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS08
    `loss from the maker's or assembler's technical fault`                    IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS08
    `operates only off public roads`                                          IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS09
    `the site where the loss occurred`                                        IS A `A kind of site` -- BS09
    `a lawful training vehicle with a certified instructor`                   IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS10
    `an instructor was present at the accident`                               IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS10
    `the auxiliary brake was fitted`                                          IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS10
    `the added equipment was declared item by item with its sum insured`      IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS11
    `the added equipment is lawful and changes no technical or safety feature` IS A BOOLEAN -- BS11
    `the sum insured for the lost item of added equipment`                    IS A NUMBER   -- BS11
    `the cost of replacing the lost item of added equipment`                  IS A NUMBER   -- BS11
    `the special vehicle is technically safe as the law requires`             IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS13
    `the operator intentionally broke the operating rules`                    IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS13
    `the battery is genuine`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS15
    `battery damage from a technical fault, wear or charging capacity`        IS A BOOLEAN  -- BS15
